<title>TUNISIA: PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Nov 18.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Nov 18.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Tunisian press on Monday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>LA PRESSE</p>
<p>- President Ben Ali congratulates King Hassan at the occasion of Morocco's Independence Day.</p>
<p>LE TEMPS</p>
<p>- Tunisia remains one of the countries less affected by AIDS: only 70 to 80 cases are detected each year.</p>
</text>
